gracePeriodSeconds--K5HaBOSáÞÛquery±The duration in seconds before the object should be deleted. Value must be non-negative integer. The value zero indicates delete immediately. If this value is nil, the default grace period for the specified type will be used. Defaults to a per object value if not specified. zero means delete immediately."gracePeriodSeconds2integer 
